{"2435980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Space Odyssey", "steam_appid": 2435980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435980/extras/91d90c8e1668ec69090a389a48658606.avif?t=1721478427\" width=616 height=306 /></span><br><br>&quot;Space Odyssey&quot; is a multiplayer online party game.<br>Players play as cute food astronauts, and maintaining a single spaceship together!<br>Ship's crews have to work together and keep the ship alive!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435980/extras/bc62365c7ea0ed833c3ca6b5e724aba7.avif?t=1721478427\" width=616 height=340 /></span><br><br>Game Features:<br>◆ 4 different spaceship roles, offering rich gameplay<br>◆ Various character appearances to choose from<br>◆ Cute characters and super cool monsters<br>◆ Online and offline modes (up to 4 players)<br>◆ Tests players' cooperation and communication skills<br><br>This game was made by five Taiwanese university students. Thank you very much for playing and supporting us.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435980/extras/64cad3c667bf3627434a9ff20bc83f91.avif?t=1721478427\" width=616 height=250 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435980/extras/94d97b16ba047098f4eb51e961c8fa5a.avif?t=1721478427\" width=616 height=308 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435980/extras/03ed70684f81860f1771d202b3a72b41.avif?t=1721478427\" width=616 height=122 /></span>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435980/extras/91d90c8e1668ec69090a389a48658606.avif?t=1721478427\" width=616 height=306 /></span><br><br>&quot;Space Odyssey&quot; is a multiplayer online party game.<br>Players play as cute food astronauts, and maintaining a single spaceship together!<br>Ship's crews have to work together and keep the ship alive!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435980/extras/bc62365c7ea0ed833c3ca6b5e724aba7.avif?t=1721478427\" width=616 height=340 /></span><br><br>Game Features:<br>◆ 4 different spaceship roles, offering rich gameplay<br>◆ Various character appearances to choose from<br>◆ Cute characters and super cool monsters<br>◆ Online and offline modes (up to 4 players)<br>◆ Tests players' cooperation and communication skills<br><br>This game was made by five Taiwanese university students. Thank you very much for playing and supporting us.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435980/extras/64cad3c667bf3627434a9ff20bc83f91.avif?t=1721478427\" width=616 height=250 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435980/extras/94d97b16ba047098f4eb51e961c8fa5a.avif?t=1721478427\" width=616 height=308 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435980/extras/03ed70684f81860f1771d202b3a72b41.avif?t=1721478427\" width=616 height=122 /></span>", "short_description": "Players play as cute food astronauts in a co-op party game. Different ship's roles like pilot, gunner, shielder, and gatherer. 'Dark Hotpot,' a new team from the 'Space Academy,' faces a colossal jellyfish alien devouring their planet. They must defeat it and say their plant.", "supported_languages": "English<str